= Roanis Elindar =

You say, 'I choose roanis'
:''Magi Frinon says 'Return this tome (Forms of Magic) to me if you wish me to summon Roanis Elindar to assist you. Destroy it if you do not. ''

:''Magi Frinon says 'Farewell.' ''
:''Magi Frinon says 'I am no longer needed and will take my leave.' ''

He despawns and Roanis Elindar, a high elf, spawns.

You say, 'hail Roanis Elindar'
:''Roanis Elindar says, 'Great, let us waste no more time! I offer to you three challenges. Summoning, Interpretation, and Displacement.  Please choose one of these.''' 

